OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murdering Jordan Webb
OL,4,Ain Portavogie
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering Jordan Webb
OL,7,Fin Portavogie in County Down.
OL,9,FMr Webb, who was 28, was found dead at
OL,10,Fa house on New Harbour Road in November
OL,11,Flast year. He had sustained multiple
OL,12,Fstab wounds.
OL,14,FKai Johnston, 22, from Springfield
OL,15,FGardens in Portavogie, appeared at
OL,16,FBelfast Crown Court on Friday.
OL,18,FJohnston replied "not guilty", when he
OL,19,Fwas charged with murder on 3 November
OL,20,F2025.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
